## Structure

```
apps/{{ name }}/
├── {{ name | pascal_case }}.slnx          # Solution (src + tests)
├── moon.yml                  # moon project config (tasks, tags, dependencies)
├── src/{{ name | pascal_case }}/          # Service source
└── tests/{{ name | pascal_case }}.Tests/  # xUnit integration tests (WebApplicationFactory)
```

## Commands

Run from the repository root:

| Command | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `make dev APP={{ name }}` | Run locally on http://localhost:{{ port }} |
| `make run APP={{ name }} TASK=test` | Run tests |
| `make run APP={{ name }} TASK=lint` | Verify formatting |
| `make run APP={{ name }} TASK=publish` | Publish the deployable artifact to `dist/` |
| `make up` | Run in Docker Compose (with all other services) |

## Endpoints

| Endpoint | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `GET /` | Service info (name, version) |
| `GET /health` | Liveness check |
| `GET /health/ready` | Readiness check |

## Configuration

| Variable | Description | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT` | Environment name | `Production` |
| `ASPNETCORE_URLS` | Listen URLs (Docker image sets `http://+:8080`) | - |

